  "2026-10-05T05:17:11.002Z",codex-sol,"Adversarial tests now reject missing or string-valued hosted opt-in before any HTTP request, including provider=ollama with an external URL override. Redirects are refused, request/response logging is disabled, and transport errors omit reflected provider bodies. HTTP tests exercise 429/529 retry limits, total deadlines, timeouts, unreachable endpoints, missing models, and malformed answers before apply."
